                <invention-title lang="de">ANZEIGEMODUL, ANZEIGEVORRICHTUNG DAMIT UND VERFAHREN ZUR HERSTELLUNG DER ANZEIGEVORRICHTUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">MODULE D'AFFICHAGE, APPAREIL D'AFFICHAGE LE COMPRENANT ET PROCÉDÉ DE FABRICATION DE L'APPAREIL D'AFFICHAGE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">DISPLAY MODULE, DISPLAY APPARATUS INCLUDING THE SAME, AND METHOD OF MANUFACTURING THE DISPLAY APPARATUS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A display module includes a display panel including a plurality of pixels, a carrier panel on a rear surface of the display panel, and an adhesive layer disposed between the display panel and the carrier panel, where the adhesive layer is in contact with the carrier panel. Lateral surfaces of the adhesive layer are recessed from lateral surfaces of the carrier panel.</p>
